{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261121/photo/bkn-20261121152657809-1121_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261121165615\"/><p>事主倒地昏迷，腳部捲入車底。</p><p>北角發生交通意外。今午(21日)3時15分，一輛私家車由福蔭道轉入宏安道時，意外撞倒一名過路女子。事主的腳部被私家車的右前轆壓住，由救援人員合力救出後，清醒被送往東區醫院治療。警員正向涉事司機了解車禍過程，正調查事故成因。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T09:03:52.845672+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":134,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T07:26:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T08:57:26.192327+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T08:57:26.192327+00:00","content_hash":"241ee9a92af37c29fd0fc3d48b03415eb40d30d7af6dd9a2527da728525a3cbd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}